n.jpg", "alt": "Visitor using a UV flashlight to reveal a fingerprint clue on a wine bottle prop"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-08-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Three visitors pointing at an interactive touchscreen analyzing the true nature of a red stain"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-09-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Character standee wall with Conan and cast dialogue speech bubbles about the exhibition mystery"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-10-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Conan and a blond-haired character figure statue wearing white gloves, displayed behind keep-out tape"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-kaohsiung-02-letsuan-design-d8aed0bb.jpg", "alt": "Split before/after view: dim empty venue shell and workers on a scissor lift installing the city-skyline backdrop graphic"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-11-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Wall of enlarged manga panel montages from the Detective Conan story"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-12-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Installation in progress: worker on a stepladder assembling modular wall panels in the unlit venue shell"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-13-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Installation in progress: crew laying out and cutting plywood wall panels across the venue floor"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-14-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Installation in progress: crew assembling concrete-look wall modules and stacking plywood panels"}, {"src": "../images/detective-conan-taipei-15-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Final installation touch-ups: worker finishing an interactive touchscreen station wall amid supply boxes"}];
